
### ==================== C ====================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "c",
  "code": "#include <stdio.h>\nint main() { printf(\"Hello from C!\"); return 0; }",
  "args": []
}

### C 带参数
POST http://localhost:8080/api/task/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "c",
  "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\nint main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\n  for (int i = 1; i < argc; i++) printf(\"arg%d=%s\\n\", i, argv[i]);\n  return 0;\n}",
  "args": ["hello", "world"]
}

